Examples for: Pizzas

Background:
  Remy is a Chef
  Chris is a Customer

Example: A new pizza is on the menu, available for sale
  When Remy creates a pizza with name "Margherita", price 1200 cents and size "large"
  Then the order is available
  And its customer name is not set

Example: A pizza takes no more than ten toppings
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Loaded", price 1500 cents and size "large"
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Basil" and amount 1
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Olives" and amount 1
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Mushroom" and amount 1
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Onion" and amount 1
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Pepper" and amount 1
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Sausage" and amount 1
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Bacon" and amount 1
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Pineapple" and amount 1
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Anchovy" and amount 1
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Jalapeno" and amount 1
  When Remy tries to add a topping to it with topping "Extra Cheese" and amount 1
  Then it is refused because at most 10 toppings

Example: A pizza with no toppings cannot be bought
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Bare", price 900 cents and size "small"
  When Chris tries to purchase it with amount 900 cents and customer name "Chris"
  Then it is refused because a pizza needs at least one topping

Example: Buying a pizza sells it
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Sold Out", price 1200 cents and size "large"
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Basil" and amount 2
  When Chris purchases it with amount 1200 cents and customer name "Chris"
  Then the order is sold
  And PizzaPurchased is announced

Example: A payment that does not cover the price is refused
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Underpaid", price 1200 cents and size "large"
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Basil" and amount 1
  When Chris tries to purchase it with amount 500 cents and customer name "Chris"
  Then it is refused because the payment covers the price

Example: A payment received through the gateway sells the pizza
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Paid For", price 1200 cents and size "large"
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Basil" and amount 1
  When the payment gateway receives it with customer name "Chris" and amount 1200 cents
  Then PizzaPaymentReceived is announced
  And PizzaPurchased is announced

Example: A payment through the gateway that does not cover the price sells nothing
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Short", price 1200 cents and size "large"
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Basil" and amount 1
  When the payment gateway receives it with customer name "Chris" and amount 500 cents
  Then PizzaPaymentReceived is announced

Example: A payment through the gateway for a pizza with no toppings sells nothing
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Plain", price 900 cents and size "small"
  When the payment gateway receives it with customer name "Chris" and amount 900 cents
  Then PizzaPaymentReceived is announced

Example: A sold pizza is no longer available
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Fresh", price 1000 cents and size "small"
  And Remy creates a pizza with name "Also Sold", price 1100 cents and size "small"
  And Remy adds a topping to it with topping "Basil" and amount 1
  And Chris purchases it with amount 1100 cents and customer name "Chris"
  When Chris runs the available query
  Then 1 order is found

Example: Orders costing less than a ceiling are found
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Bargain", price 800 cents and size "small"
  And Remy creates a pizza with name "Splurge", price 1800 cents and size "large"
  When Chris runs the costing less than query with ceiling 1000 cents
  Then 1 order is found

Example: An available order can be read field by field
  Given Remy creates a pizza with name "Only One", price 950 cents and size "small"
  When Chris runs the available query
  Then the order is available
  And its name is "Only One"
